      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's weird, it's right here in my dashboard under \"Pending Approvals - Infrastructure Upgrades.\" It's for the Gen-7 compute modules for the main cluster. I'm looking at the spec sheet now... they use the new architecture. \n\nSince you manage the maintenance and lifecycle, check your internal logs again. Once those arrive, the plan is to swap out the old units to get the fabrication throughput up. Any reason it wouldn't show up on your end?",
